{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The world doesn't need saving, so go ahead and have fun.&quot; - Morgan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raising simulation meets cute and cozy heroic fantasy. Learn skills by taking classes, earn money with part time jobs (or asking her majesty for pocket money), fight enemies in turn based JRPG combat. And, once you're prepared, her majesty might even assign you a mission or two to complete. Go on visual novel adventures to places like the Black Forest, filled with lush greenery and proud orcs, Tara, the Principality of Knights and Snow, or even Albion itself, a magical kingdom built atop the remains of the oldest empire of demonkind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Niziiro Mao, a happy-go-lucky Ink Mage currently working as a maid for the royal palace. You rarely do housework, but her majesty seems to be letting it slide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have the vague feeling her majesty is preparing you for something, but you're not sure what. For now, let's focus on studying and getting strong. Maybe her majesty tell you more after you've proven yourself by climbing the tower or changing your class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Walk around,  meet new people, have adventures, and maybe even learn how to cast something a little flashier than a paintball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_155159.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If things get too stressful, take a walk, eat something delicious, or have a nice nap to keep yourself rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her majesty has a considerably laissez-faire approach to education, so you are free to make your own schedule. However, although her backing means you can try any job or class you'd like, you still need to work hard yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-50-08.gif?t=1743914605\" /><br><br>A slight painting accident. Sadly, you don't get paid for unsuccessful work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-50-53_1.gif?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asking her majesty for pocket money. (You can usually find her in the Reception Hall. Walk around the Palace if you don't know where it is.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-52-49.gif?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should they really be teaching Fireball in school?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-56-47.gif?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then again, they already taught you Meteor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153436.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trash talk after dropping a giant flaming rock on an adventuring party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153704.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hat based political hierarchy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_154241.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A slightly depressed goblin, Oliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153329.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mission to conquer the world? (And quite possibly the least secret agent who ever lived.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153833.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Niziiro Mao, fighter of slimes and paper dolls. The super fighting expert who conveniently forgot to mention that she lost some of those matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>It's the first day of the year, you had a fun birthday party yesterday, and there's a knock on your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/mtn_04_072.png?t=1743914605\" />Currently in development for PC and Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;My greatest wish? I suppose it would be my entry in the history books. I would like to have a little footnote with the date of my coronation, the date of the end of my reign, and a statement saying 'nothing of note happened under her reign.' It's a little amusing. Things like bountiful harvests, children's smiles, and peaceful, ordinary days never make it into the books. And let's keep it that way, shall we? Even if the sky falls, I'll be here to hold it up.&quot; - Morgan</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552520?t=1743914605","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552520?t=1743914605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/f96ba65236153b64fc498c815d5e1a96268f6294/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743914605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/f96ba65236153b64fc498c815d5e1a96268f6294/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743914605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3637780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;The world doesn't need saving, so go ahead and have fun.&quot; - Morgan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raising simulation meets cute and cozy heroic fantasy. Learn skills by taking classes, earn money with part time jobs (or asking her majesty for pocket money), fight enemies in turn based JRPG combat. And, once you're prepared, her majesty might even assign you a mission or two to complete. Go on visual novel adventures to places like the Black Forest, filled with lush greenery and proud orcs, Tara, the Principality of Knights and Snow, or even Albion itself, a magical kingdom built atop the remains of the oldest empire of demonkind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Niziiro Mao, a happy-go-lucky Ink Mage currently working as a maid for the royal palace. You rarely do housework, but her majesty seems to be letting it slide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have the vague feeling her majesty is preparing you for something, but you're not sure what. For now, let's focus on studying and getting strong. Maybe her majesty tell you more after you've proven yourself by climbing the tower or changing your class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Walk around,  meet new people, have adventures, and maybe even learn how to cast something a little flashier than a paintball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_155159.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If things get too stressful, take a walk, eat something delicious, or have a nice nap to keep yourself rested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Her majesty has a considerably laissez-faire approach to education, so you are free to make your own schedule. However, although her backing means you can try any job or class you'd like, you still need to work hard yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-50-08.gif?t=1743914605\" /><br><br>A slight painting accident. Sadly, you don't get paid for unsuccessful work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-50-53_1.gif?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asking her majesty for pocket money. (You can usually find her in the Reception Hall. Walk around the Palace if you don't know where it is.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-52-49.gif?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should they really be teaching Fireball in school?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/2025-04-04_16-56-47.gif?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then again, they already taught you Meteor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153436.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trash talk after dropping a giant flaming rock on an adventuring party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153704.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hat based political hierarchy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_154241.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A slightly depressed goblin, Oliver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153329.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mission to conquer the world? (And quite possibly the least secret agent who ever lived.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-04_153833.png?t=1743914605\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Niziiro Mao, fighter of slimes and paper dolls. The super fighting expert who conveniently forgot to mention that she lost some of those matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>It's the first day of the year, you had a fun birthday party yesterday, and there's a knock on your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/extras/mtn_04_072.png?t=1743914605\" />Currently in development for PC and Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;My greatest wish? I suppose it would be my entry in the history books. I would like to have a little footnote with the date of my coronation, the date of the end of my reign, and a statement saying 'nothing of note happened under her reign.' It's a little amusing. Things like bountiful harvests, children's smiles, and peaceful, ordinary days never make it into the books. And let's keep it that way, shall we? Even if the sky falls, I'll be here to hold it up.&quot; - Morgan</p>","developers":["Sleepy Cat Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552520/8d876c4b1db6096b43e73c8ff6d6ea25c154e378/header.jpg?t=1743914605","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101030,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101030/movie480.mp4?t=1743813654","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101030/movie_max.mp4?t=1743813654"},"name":"First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101030/01877a23debc28889332ea7b910be090168874a1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743813654","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101030/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743813654","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101030/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743813654"}}],"name":"Raising Niziiro: Albion's Witch","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for Vulkan 1.2</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publish